## 3. Derivatives and mandatory share-back

You may modify the Software and create derivative works for noncommercial
use under Section 2, provided that, for any modification you deploy, run
for longer than personal/local testing, or distribute to any other
person:

a) You notify the Licensor (contact: the address/handle designated in
